%% title: Notification Delivery Flow
sequenceDiagram
  participant SVC as Originating service<br/>(account/kyc/consent/transaction)
  participant K as Kafka<br/>openbank.notification.requests
  participant NS as notification-service
  participant DB as PostgreSQL<br/>notifications + outbox
  participant DT as device_tokens
  participant SMTP as SMTP mailer<br/>(email)
  participant FCM as FCM / APNs<br/>(push)
  participant SL as Slack webhook<br/>(oversight, ADR-0059)

  SVC->>K: NotificationRequest<br/>{partyId, channel, template, recipient, vars}
  K->>NS: consume NotificationRequest
  NS->>NS: render template → subject + body
  NS->>DB: INSERT notifications<br/>(status=PENDING)

  alt channel = EMAIL
    NS->>SMTP: send rendered email
    SMTP-->>NS: delivered / error
    NS->>DB: UPDATE status=SENT / FAILED
  else channel = PUSH
    NS->>DT: SELECT active tokens WHERE party_id=…
    DT-->>NS: [token1, token2, …]
    loop per device token
      NS->>FCM: send push notification
      FCM-->>NS: success / invalid-token
      alt invalid token
        NS->>DT: UPDATE status=RETIRED
      end
    end
    NS->>DB: UPDATE status=SENT / FAILED
  end

  alt template in risk allow-list
    NS->>SL: anonymized oversight signal<br/>(no PII, event type only)
  end

  NS->>DB: INSERT notification_outbox\n(relay event downstream)
